# Benchmark scene data (see "Real scenes" in CLAUDE.md) — large binaries in LFS.
# OBJs are committed zstd-compressed (.obj.zst, ~6x — OBJ is ASCII text; the
# loader decodes transparently); the plain-.obj pattern stays as a guard so an
# accidental re-add of an uncompressed mesh can't bloat plain git history.
# Scoped to scenes/ so the repo-root check*.png verification images stay plain git.
scenes/**/*.zst filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
scenes/**/*.obj filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
scenes/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
